  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with our customizable Jeminise Bible Verse Blanket. This meaningful blanket is designed to wrap you in warmth and peace, featuring uplifting scripture and a soft, skin-friendly fabric. It's an ideal keepsake for believers who cherish inspiration and a faith-filled home, perfect for quiet time or prayer.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a unique, heartfelt blanket that celebrates faith.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Uplifting Scripture:</strong> Features bible verses for daily encouragement and spiritual reflection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Skin-Friendly:</strong> Made from soft, skin-friendly fabric, blending comfort with faith.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> A beautiful religious gift for mom, grandma, daughter, or any Christian woman for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and air dry for quick, convenient cleaning.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor use, offering warmth and peace in any setting.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14 (butterflies, floral, cloud, cross)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Bible Verse Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
